## Required accounting formulas

For retailer consignment inventory:

Opening stock
+ Verified deliveries
- Verified sales
- Approved returns
- Approved damage adjustments
= Closing retailer stock.

Retailer receivable:

Opening receivable
+ New consignment sales receivables
+ Approved financial adjustments
- Verified payments allocated
- Approved credit notes
= Closing receivable.

Agent custody:

Opening agent custody
+ Warehouse deliveries
- Retailer deliveries
- Warehouse returns
- Approved adjustments
= Closing agent custody.

Agent cash:

Opening cash held
+ Verified collections made by agent
- Verified remittances to owner
= Closing cash held.

Warehouse inventory:

Opening stock
+ Verified supplier receipts
+ Verified returns from agents
+ Verified returns from retailers
- Agent deliveries
- B2C fulfillment
- Approved write-offs
= Closing warehouse stock.

Run automated reconciliation tests.

Never silently overwrite balances.

